estones.md:52:| Agent/automation control API (MCP class) | emerging | editor-architect | `ED.ARCH.llm-agent-frontend` | MCP integrations for major engines (2025); EA SEED RL testing | Stable protocol adoption | CLI/commandlets |\ndata/radar.json:472:    \"ED.ARCH.llm-agent-frontend\"\nM0 Walking skeleton ['QA.HOST.runner', 'XC.DET.conformance', 'QA.ROBUST.fuzzing', 'OBS.LOG.bench-runtime'] []\nM1 Indie 2D slice on PC ['QA.REF.ladder', 'QA.SIM.netsim', 'XC.SEC.threats', 'XC.SEC.hardening', 'BLD.SYS.dev-surface-exclusion', 'PRF.LOAD.hitch-gate'] ['indie-2d-client@pc', 'minimal-client@pc']\nM2 Indie 2D ships everywhere, with tools ['QA.CERT.prechecks', 'ED.COLLAB.vcs', 'NET.PRED.rollback', 'GAM.FW.local-players'] ['indie-2d-client', 'minimal-client', 'indie-2d-tools', 'minimal-tools', 'mobile-async-client', 'fighting-2d-rollback-client', 'sandbox-2d-client']\nM3 Standard 3D ['QA.RENDER.reference-validation', 'RND.SHADER.pso-lists', 'CORE.SCALE.governor', 'XC.ITER.metrics'] ['standard-3d-client', 'standard-3d-tools', 'lite-3d-mobile-client', 'lite-3d-mobile-tools', 'lite-3d-portable-console-client', 'racing-3d-client']\nM4 Online ['QA.FUNC.load', 'NET.TRANS.dos', 'BLD.REL.staged-rollout', 'BLD.REL.rollback', 'PRF.NET.bandwidth'] ['online-3d-server', 'online-3d-client', 'online-3d-bot-client', 'online-3d-tools', 'online-3d-console-client', 'coop-3d-listen-client', 'lite-3d-mobile-online-client', 'indie-2d-online-web-client', 'indie-2d-online-moddable-client', 'indie-2d-online-moddable-server', 'rts-2d-massim-client']\nM5 Open world, simulation & XR ['RES.MGMT.arbitration', 'RES.MGMT.validation', 'PRF.BENCH.scale-content'] ['open-world-client', 'rts-3d-massim-client', 'sandbox-online-server', 'xr-pc-client', 'xr-standalone-client', 'xr-console-client']\nM6 AAA & ecosystem ['NET.SRV.cross-server', 'XC.SEC.sandbox', 'ED.COLLAB.multiuser'] ['aaa-open-world-online-client', 'aaa-open-world-online-server', 'aaa-open-world-online-tools', 'aaa-experimental-client']\nM7 Engine 1.0