{"parentUuid":"4a177c0f-f0de-48fc-a87a-23b6f362d3b1","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"ae2337b31e58469c0","attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14881992 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"0ad83008-6bf0-4c85-8e1b-89de6ae1585a","timestamp":"2026-09-30T07:22:22.450Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14881992 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"claude/engine-skill-framework-phase1","slug":"warm-pondering-kernighan"}
{"parentUuid":"0ad83008-6bf0-4c85-8e1b-89de6ae1585a","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"ae2337b31e58469c0","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CfZDonQupH1qfmdxQoaT3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"13 of 17 findings confirmed (fact and materiality both hold); the other four (K-SEC-6, 8, 12, 15) are not confirmed.\n\n- **K-SEC-1:** confirmed on fact and materiality, but the severity is wrong. It should be minor: saves are still fuzzed and limited, and check.py does not read the trust field.\n- **K-SEC-6:** the fact fails, because `XC.SEC.agent-boundary` already covers agent capability scoping.\n- **K-SEC-8:** the fact holds but it is not material. The editor LLM front end is an emerging capability, and `editor-architect` already owns the workspace-trust gating.\n- **K-SEC-12:** the fact holds but it is not material. Plugin signing and workspace trust are already covered by `XC.SEC.dev-trust`.\n- **K-SEC-15:** the fact fails, and ownership of `XC.SEC.tamper` is defensible.\n\nI ran `check.py` (0 errors, 0 warnings); it does not check any of these.\n\nResults are in `/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-skills/64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82/scratchpad/verify_out_K-SEC.json`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3456,"cache_read_input_tokens":114582,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3456,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":421,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfZDomydPAc7hf43SpSm8","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"b893f2f7-cf24-4c8e-aea5-4bb1a60e57be","timestamp":"2026-09-30T07:22:26.150Z","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"claude/engine-skill-framework-phase1","slug":"warm-pondering-kernighan"}
